  "descriptionMarkdown": "Includes a blackout-safe design; the large power poles on the left and right disconnect if internal accumulator charge drops below 50%. This prevents your inserters from running out of power. The solar panels inside the build are enough for a low-power state that will swing the inserters during the day, if you fully run out of power. The roboports are aligned to a roboport grid, so this is should be compatible with most roboport-based grids.",
